.\" Pipe this output to groff -m man -K utf8 -T utf8 | less -R
.\"
.mso an.tmac
.TH "DUNE-HELP" 1 "" "Dune 3.24.2" "Dune Manual"
.\" Disable hyphenation and ragged-right
.nh
.ad l
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.P
dune\N'45'help \N'45' Additional Dune help\N'46'
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.P
\fBdune help\fR [\fB\N'45'\N'45'build\N'45'info\fR] [\fB\N'45'\N'45'man\N'45'format\fR=\fIFMT\fR] [\fIOPTION\fR]… [\fITOPIC\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.P
\fBdune help TOPIC\fR provides additional help on the given topic\N'46' The following topics are available:
.TP 4
\fBconfig\fR
dune\N'45'config
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP 4
\fB\N'45'\N'45'build\N'45'info\fR
Show build information\N'46'
.TP 4
\fB\N'45'\N'45'man\N'45'format\fR=\fIFMT\fR (absent=\fBpager\fR)
Show output in format \fIFMT\fR\N'46' The value \fIFMT\fR must be one of \fBauto\fR, \fBpager\fR, \fBgroff\fR or \fBplain\fR\N'46' With \fBauto\fR, the format is \fBpager\fR or \fBplain\fR whenever the \fBTERM\fR env var is \fBdumb\fR or undefined\N'46'
.SH COMMON OPTIONS
.TP 4
\fB\N'45'\N'45'help\fR[=\fIFMT\fR] (default=\fBauto\fR)
Show this help in format \fIFMT\fR\N'46' The value \fIFMT\fR must be one of \fBauto\fR, \fBpager\fR, \fBgroff\fR or \fBplain\fR\N'46' With \fBauto\fR, the format is \fBpager\fR or \fBplain\fR whenever the \fBTERM\fR env var is \fBdumb\fR or undefined\N'46'
.TP 4
\fB\N'45'\N'45'version\fR
Show version information\N'46'
.SH "وضعیت خروج (EXIT STATUS)"
.P
\fBdune help\fR exits with:
.TP 4
0
on success\N'46'
.TP 4
1
if an error happened\N'46'
.TP 4
130
if it was interrupted by a signal\N'46'
.SH "محیط (ENVIRONMENT)"
.P
These environment variables affect the execution of \fBhelp\fR:
.TP 4
\fBCLICOLOR\fR
If different than \fB0\fR, ANSI colors are supported and should be used when the program isn\N'39't piped\N'46' If equal to \fB0\fR, don\N'39't output ANSI color escape codes
.TP 4
\fBCLICOLOR_FORCE\fR
If different than \fB0\fR, ANSI colors should be enabled no matter what\N'46'
.TP 4
\fBDUNE_CACHE_ROOT\fR
If set, determines the location of all the different caches used by dune\N'46'
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.P
Check bug reports at https://github\N'46'com/ocaml/dune/issues
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.P
dune(1)